+# Joint clock/time transfer and finite-volume physical states
+
+Personal derivation milestone from the continuous-time bridge campaign. The supplied finite-clock transfer can approach a different kinetic law if clock resolution and time step are linked naively. An exact variance calibration removes that ambiguity on every simultaneous clock/time path at a fixed finite spatial graph. An all-mode energy floor then controls the actual low-energy spaces and thermal states.
+
+The two proposed mathematical results are:
+
+- [Calibrated transfer and core/product limit](notes/BLOCK02_CALIBRATED_CLOCK_ROTOR_TRANSFER_THEOREM.md): exact character crossover, unique variance calibration, uniform fourth moment, positive coupled transfer and exact Gauss restriction.
+- [All-mode floor and physical states](notes/BLOCK03_ALL_MODE_COERCIVITY_AND_FINITE_VOLUME_STATES.md): theta-product coercivity, compactness, norm resolvent convergence, spectral multiplicities and trace-norm Gibbs convergence.
+
+[Charged-ring conventions](notes/BLOCK03_CHARGED_RING_CHECK_CONVENTIONS.md) describe the noncommuting finite check. Two programs compare different kernel/physical-space constructions. Fourteen genuinely altered sources fail their assertions. All failed attempts, diagnostic versions and numerical corrections remain in [numerical history](review/NUMERICAL_HISTORY.md).
+
+These are author proposals with current surface status `conditional-support`, not independent or retained results. [Claim status](CLAIM_STATUS_CERTIFICATE.md), [personal review](review/PERSONAL_PROOF_REVIEW.md), [premises and boundary checks](review/PREMISES_AND_BOUNDARIES.md), and [reading record](READING_LEDGER.md) state the limits. The generic logarithmic temporal/spatial matching already exists in main, and earlier personal work already treats other fixed-volume rotor approximations. The new target is the calibrated actual transfer on arbitrary joint paths, with no hidden low-energy modular states.
+
+The spatial thermodynamic limit and a fixed-clock, fixed-coupling phase remain unresolved. No native action/time/coupling, massless interacting matter, axiom update or complete TOE is established. Formal registration, canonical audit evidence, integrated landing checks and independent review remain pending. Editable prompt files: none.
